# =====================================================================
# 数据隐私：所有输入数据和由数据生成的产物一律不进仓库
# =====================================================================

# 1) 数据目录（整目录忽略，只保留说明文件）
experiments/*
!experiments/README.md
export/*
!export/README.md
workspace/
private/
# Aspen PIMS 导出的解报告（FullSolution*.htm）
pims-results/

# 含真实案例（物料/装置代码、经济数值）的内部文档：只留本地
rps_tools/diagnose/CAPABILITIES.md
rps_tools/diagnose/README.md
rps_tools/exp_analyzer/PROJECT.md
rps_tools/exp_analyzer/TRIAGE.md

# 2) 全局兜底：任何位置的数据 / 产物文件，防止放错目录被误提交
*.json
*.jsonl
*.mps
*.xmps
*.freemps
*.lp
*.txt
*.log
*.csv
*.tsv
*.xls
*.xlsx
*.mmd
*.html
*.htm
*.jsx
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
*.parquet
*.pkl
*.npy
*.npz
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.tar
*.tgz
*.gz
*.pptx
*.docx
*.pdf

# 3) 白名单：项目自身需要的、不含数据的文件
!requirements.txt
!rps_tools/web/static/index.html
!rps_tools/exp_analyzer/sample_patch.json
!scripts/privacy_allowlist.txt

# =====================================================================
# 本地环境 / 密钥
# =====================================================================
.env
.env.*
# Claude Code：只共享角色定义（.claude/agents/），本地设置不提交
.claude/*
!.claude/agents/
.vscode/
.idea/

# Python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
